  "notes": "Adds a fixture-first promotion verification executor that composes current readiness and Cosign-plan validators with exact-byte tool, subject, bundle, policy, EvidenceBundle, STAC/DCAT/PROV, and rollback checks. The corrective change bootstraps the repository root before package imports and adds a direct-file-entrypoint regression. It executes no production cryptography and never promotes, releases, deploys, or publishes."
